<title>NETHERLANDS: FORECAST - Dutch company results April 21-25.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Dutch company results April 21-25.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of Dutch company result for the week of April 21-25:</p>
<p>DATE--COMPANY----PERIOD--PROFIT------CONSENSUS---RANGE-----PVS</p>
<p>22/4  Polygram   Q1 97   net ord ops    137     120/150    124</p>
<p>23/4  Philips    Q1 97   net ord ops    366     300/534    377</p>
<p>23/4  Baan	 Q1 97   net ord ops     11	 9/13	 4</p>
<p>25/4  Akzo	 Q1 97   net ord ops    363     332/380    332</p>
<p>NOTES - Profit figures exclude extraordinary items and are in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated. They are stated before deduction of preference dividends where applicable.</p>
<p>* BAAN estimates are in U.S. dollars</p>
<p>FORECASTS CONTRIBUTED BY: Amstgeld, Bangert Pontier, BZW, Delta Lloyd Bank, Generale Bank, ING Barings, Kempen &amp; Co, Labouchere, Van Lanschot, NIB Securities, SNS Securities.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
